 t celebrates the centennial of Fernando Birri (1925–2017)\, the pioneeri
 ng Argentine filmmaker\, artist\, and theorist of the New Latin American C
 inema.\nCategory:  Open to the Public\nOriginal listing: https://events.br
 own.edu/library/event/341424-a-pictorial-dragon-the-art-of-fernando-birri
